sued SAR 5,000,000). Reading B: 2.1 reduces the ADD-02 amount by SAR 1,000,000 (result to be computed by a person/approved method). ADD-03:1.2 says references are to the clause 'as amended by Addenda Nos. 1 and 2', favouring the ADD-02 base. The cover does not amend; which governs is a person's decision. No op proposed for VOL-V:36.2.", "theme": "change_in_law"}, "provision": "ADD-03:2.1", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "3edcf917cfc134e6f46c5e95e8b0f9c45b18dd217d59e0c837d695d96aa5fa91", "assumptions_sha256": "1be8633a5dbbfbee53f7637e0fe9f82ab864f0adf635993ad4d69bac9f45ce4d", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "016a2c8b1f208df57a5ef3d1043d27773982ec470e480fbfb158127ddad15255", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "8987c98f5ba445d48382f8dfe85f2fd9bbd6ccb50b4546d9746446ce1df73582", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "5fabc7a7b410afa51931616e3954a56ba1933b480343a66f4bfd86649b55c0a0", "register_sha256": "7f7fa1b15632133b0e2e1a52f97887f4be357e56287a236085431e9c1281d3b1", "relationships_sha256": "13add9af8306bf534196666e68c36a9973764a70ead56b0dc79806523b982b6e", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "issue", "target": "VOL-V:36.2"}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:1.1", "words": "This Addendum is issued under Volume I Clause 5.3 and takes precedence over Addenda Nos. 1 and 2 in accordance with Volume I Clause 3.2."}], "id": "ADD-03/1.1/disp", "payload": {"candidates": ["VOL-I:5.3", "VOL-I:3.2"], "disposition": "no_effect", "provision": "ADD-03:1.1", "reason": "Recital stating the authority for issue and that the Addendum 'takes precedence over Addenda Nos. 1 and 2 in accordance with Volume I Clause 3.2'; it restates the existing Clause 3.2 order of precedence and edits no unit. A person c